{
  "id": "JOB.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 20",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zophar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Zophar the Naamathite replied:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"My troubled thoughts prompt me to answer",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "because I am greatly disturbed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hear a rebuke that dishonors me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and my understanding inspires me to reply.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Surely you know how it has been from of old,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ever since mankind",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "was placed on the earth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that the mirth of the wicked is brief,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the joy of the godless lasts but a moment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though the pride of the godless person reaches to the heavens",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and his head touches the clouds,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he will perish forever, like his own dung;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "those who have seen him will say, 'Where is he?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like a dream he flies away, no more to be found,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "banished like a vision of the night.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The eye that saw him will not see him again;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "his place will look on him no more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His children must make amends to the poor;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "his own hands must give back his wealth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The youthful vigor that fills his bones",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "will lie with him in the dust.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Though evil is sweet in his mouth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and he hides it under his tongue,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "though he cannot bear to let it go",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and lets it linger in his mouth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yet his food will turn sour in his stomach;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "it will become the venom of serpents within him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will spit out the riches he swallowed;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "God will make his stomach vomit them up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will suck the poison of serpents;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the fangs of an adder will kill him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will not enjoy the streams,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the rivers flowing with honey and cream.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What he toiled for he must give back uneaten;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he will not enjoy the profit from his trading.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he has oppressed the poor and left them destitute;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 20:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he has seized houses he did not build.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
